{"data":{"body":"[P2] Include the testing-model fixes in the root-cause account\n\nRule 5, **A bug fix starts with a failing test**, requires the description to name each bug's root cause. The description explains fixture and evidence-protocol problems but omits these shipped testing-library fixes: terminal events retaining retry metadata and event-ID reassignment dropping invocation completion details. These independently affect public history results. Return to the design phase (rule 8, step 6) and include their causes and reproducing tests in the agreed scope.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM8AAAABFG3Nyw","finding_digest":"077063b70646c48dae0110df99808712a68ab55eba4b6682edc2452866c458f7","finding_id":"arf_v1_a5yghnygi3ci3lqbcdpztaehck","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/model.py::eventcreationcontext.get_retry_details::undocumented-bugfix-root-cause","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/model.py::eventcreationcontext.get_retry_details::undocumented-bugfix-root-cause","line":1345,"observation_digest":"958e44ff2d39c785e829dbb74f34d416cb6c2f514143f6341bf9e09ded34feb5","observation_id":"aro_v1_swhej7znhhdyl2bj3o3u6nguc3","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/model.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_a5yghnygi3ci3lqbcdpztaehck","published_at":"2026-11-20T02:19:49Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zhjij4lphcy5mipsdzggykhno5","reviewed_base_sha":"e7c09658bcf95ecab27d0d0c565d11b21dc5883e","reviewed_head_sha":"5fc72e865278207c5c2153ab91ad29ebe2cc2634","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1342,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":931},"record_id":"art_v1_ia3qfrf34nyz35c2akodby5raw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-20T02:19:49Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
